sequenceDiagram
    participant Owner
    participant API as /api/files/:id/share
    participant Guest
    participant Share as /api/share/:id/*
    participant FS as Uploads

    Owner->>API: PATCH visibility=public (optional regenerateToken)
    API->>Meta: updateShareState/refreshShareToken
    API-->>Owner: Share URL + token
    Guest->>Share: GET metadata?token=...
    Share->>Meta: Fetch metadata (visibility/token check)
    alt Token ok and file exists
        Share-->>Guest: Metadata + share URL
        Guest->>Share: GET preview/download
        Share->>FS: Stream file (range supported)
        Share-->>Guest: File content
    else
        Share-->>Guest: 401/403/404
    end
